# Rule: new_network_connection
# Category: Behavioral Anomaly
# Severity: medium
# Attack Class: behavioral_anomaly
#
# Detects DNS lookups for domains associated with data exfiltration,
# tunneling, or Command & Control (C2) infrastructure.
#
# Matches:
#   - Dynamic DNS providers (duckdns, no-ip, dynu)
#   - Tunneling services (ngrok, serveo, localtunnel)
#   - Paste/file sharing sites (pastebin, transfer.sh, file.io)
#   - Webhook testing tools (webhook.site, requestbin, pipedream)
#   - Tor-related domains (.onion, .tor2web)
#
# In Phase 2, this will be enhanced with a per-agent learning phase
# that tracks "normal" DNS patterns and alerts on never-seen-before domains.

event.type == "NETWORK_DNS"
AND regex_match("(?i)(duckdns\\.org|no-ip\\.(com|org)|dynu\\.com|ngrok\\.io|serveo\\.net|localtunnel\\.me|pastebin\\.com|hastebin\\.com|paste\\.ee|transfer\\.sh|file\\.io|webhook\\.site|requestbin|pipedream\\.net|\\.onion|\\.tor2web)", event.raw_data.dns.query_name)
